@startuml
autonumber
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam BoxPadding 10

actor User
participant "Vue.js" as Web
participant "Laravel" as Controller
participant "Valkey" as Queue
participant "Queue Worker" as Job
participant "Scapy" as Python
database PostgreSQL as DB

== File Upload and Job Dispatch ==
User -> Web: Upload .pcap file
activate User
activate Web
Web -> Controller: POST /file/uploadPcap
activate Controller
Controller -> Controller: Save file
Controller -> Queue: Dispatch background job
Controller -> DB: Insert redis_job (status: dispatching)
Controller --> Web: Redirect response
deactivate Controller
Web --> User: Show Progress Bar
deactivate Web

== Background Processing ==
Job -> Queue: Poll for next job
activate Job
Queue --> Job: Return job data
Job -> Python: Run analyze.py
activate Python
Python -> DB: Update progress_percentage
Python -> DB: Batch insert packets
Python --> Job: Exit (success/fail)
deactivate Python
Job -> DB: Update redis_job (status: finished/failed)
Job -> Job: Remove file
deactivate Job

== Result Viewing ==
User -> Web: View Analysis page
activate Web
Web -> Controller: GET /pcap/analysis/{id}
activate Controller
Controller -> DB: Query packets data
activate DB
DB --> Controller: Return dataset
deactivate DB
Controller --> Web: Return data
deactivate Controller
Web --> User: Render results
deactivate Web
deactivate User

@enduml
